<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>hyponoia</id>
    <version>0.8.1</version>
    <title>hyponoia</title>
    <authors>patalbansishashank</authors>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/patalbansishashank/hyponoia</projectUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/patalbansishashank/hyponoia/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/patalbansishashank/hyponoia</projectSourceUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/patalbansishashank/hyponoia/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>mcp ai claude code-intelligence codebase developer-tools tree-sitter llm</tags>
    <summary>Fast code intelligence engine for AI coding agents</summary>
    <description>
hyponoia is a native MCP server distributed with authenticated
release-owned runtime assets. Chocolatey retains the complete extracted runtime
set and exposes its executable through a PATH shim.

Full indexes an average repository in milliseconds, the Linux kernel (28M LOC) in
3 minutes. Answers structural queries in under 1ms. Supports 159 languages via
vendored tree-sitter grammars. No hosted service or API key. Plug and play across
11 coding agents including Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, and Zed.

After installation, run:

    hyponoia install

to configure your coding agents automatically.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/patalbansishashank/hyponoia/releases/tag/v0.8.1</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
